<title>USA: Castle to buy back up to 1 million shares.</title>
<headline>Castle to buy back up to 1 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>RADNOR, Pa. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Castle Energy Corp said on Tuesday that it will repurchase up to 1 million shares of its common stock, which constitutes approximately 15 percent of the outstanding common stock, over the next six months.</p>
<p>Joseph L. Castle II, Castle's chairman and chief executive officer, said that the board of directors believes that the common stock represents an attractive investment opportunity for the Company at recent market prices.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
